graph TD
    Start([User]) --> Nav{Navigate to<br>/banlist/history}
    Nav --> Timeline[Browse Timeline<br>grouped by month]
    Timeline --> Filter{Apply Filters?}
    Filter -->|Format| FormatFilter[Select Format<br>from dropdown]
    Filter -->|Date Range| DateFilter[Set From/To dates]
    Filter -->|No| Browse[Browse Events]
    FormatFilter --> Browse
    DateFilter --> Browse
    Browse --> LoadMore{More events?}
    LoadMore -->|Yes| Load[Click Load More<br>offset pagination]
    Load --> Browse
    LoadMore -->|No| ClickCard[Click Card Event]
    ClickCard --> CardDetail[View Card Detail<br>/collection/:id]
    CardDetail --> ExpandBH[Expand Ban History<br>section - collapsed]
    ExpandBH --> FetchBH[Lazy-fetch<br>card ban history]
    FetchBH --> ViewBH[View card-specific<br>ban timeline]

    Admin([Admin]) --> Sync[Trigger Ban List Sync<br>F41]
    Sync --> NewEntries[New history entries<br>appear in timeline]
    NewEntries --> Timeline
